# Recipe stage 1 (PLAN.md v2 section 5 + user decision 3): family-c layouts head-to-head with config a at a 1M FP16 cache.
# Code: dsv41-all tip 5e55c062 (base upstream dev 988fa662 v1.5.2; = validated be33b0e1 + the Python-only recurrent-cache
# fix), source /root/rnd/release/all/src-5e55c0627ece (set by WS_SRC in the window's environment), native
# native-5e55c0627ece -> native-b8105f2d6a05 (sha256 823174af46fb, sm_80 + sm_120a). Harness recipe/bench2 (version 4).
# ONE window (written reason in STAGE_1.md): 1A mirrored H2H-full (A1M C12 C11 C10 C8 | C8 C10 C11 C12 A1M), then 1C
# S4-512K per c split, then 1B (64K quality of the new splits, the static-slice arms C12-S / C12-C). Conditional lines
# (C2, an extra a / best-c pair) are appended to the requeue file after 1A is read.
# C12 runs plain (chunk 4096): its pipelined prefill OOMs on the CMP at 1M (stage 0, 3.2); C11 / C10 / C8 pipelined with
# 4096-row sub-chunks and a 16384-token generator chunk (plan template C<s>). The plan's separate C12-plain arm is C12 itself.
# Memory: every line under py_memwatch (8 GiB floor, kills only its own PID, writes *.KILLED) in a swap-0 cgroup of 119G
# (127.8 GB) for a and family c; a's pinned + resident stays <= 120 GB by ram experts=102GiB (RSS 107.9 GiB measured).
# minavail = expected RSS + ~20 GiB. The driver stops the window on any memory kill.

# ---- 1A: H2H-full, mirrored (2 processes per arm; a gets processes 3 / 4 after 0c's A1M-1 / A1M-2)
#@ est=9 timeout=1500 minavail=124
A1M-3 | BENCH_PYTHON=/root/rnd/release/all/aux/py_memwatch.sh MEMWATCH_PY=/root/rnd/release/recipe/bench2/py_mem.sh PYTORCH_ALLOC_CONF=backend:cudaMallocAsync PYTORCH_CUDA_ALLOC_CONF=backend:cudaMallocAsync PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 MEMMAX=119G CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 EXL3_PLACEMENT='*=cuda:0 experts=cache; ram experts=102GiB' | --modes h2h --scenarios full --cache-tokens 1048576 --max-output-size 32 --engram-drop --timeline 32 --expect-native-sha 823174af46fb
#@ est=12 timeout=1500 minavail=87
C12-2 | BENCH_PYTHON=/root/rnd/release/all/aux/py_memwatch.sh MEMWATCH_PY=/root/rnd/release/recipe/bench2/py_mem.sh PYTORCH_ALLOC_CONF=backend:cudaMallocAsync PYTORCH_CUDA_ALLOC_CONF=backend:cudaMallocAsync PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 MEMMAX=119G EXL3_PLACEMENT='0-11=cuda:0; 12-39=cuda:1 experts=cache; ram experts=all; disk experts=off' | --modes h2h --scenarios full --chunk 4096 --cache-tokens 1048576 --max-output-size 32 --engram-drop --timeline 32 --expect-native-sha 823174af46fb
#@ est=11 timeout=1500 minavail=92
